Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Saved places: drop the Phase 7 client adapter that no
 longer links (RC1, RC2)

The assistant's save confirm now files the place through services/saved.js
addPlace() into the requested list, and refuses a place without coordinates
with a plain notice. services/saved-places.js and components/place/save-button.js
imported createSavedPlacesService, which this PR removed from services/saved.js,
so the browser module graph failed to link and no screen rendered. Adds
tests/client-module-graph.test.js, which fails on any such link error.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
