Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Saved lists: stable default-list slugs and a
 coordinates-only assistant save (RC2, RC3)

saved_lists gains system_key in place (ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS plus a
partial unique index per owner); the four defaults are created with it.
GET /lists/:id and POST /lists/:id/items accept favorites, want_to_visit,
travel or restaurants and resolve them among the viewer's own lists only,
so #/saved?list=favorites and the assistant's listRef work again and keep
working after a rename. Cards carry systemKey. The save_place tool schema
requires lat and lng, which a saved item needs.

